  description: Goblins are said to be fairies who became hideous demons after being
    possessed by evil spirits. The mischievous nature of their fairy hearts lead
    them to cause trouble for humans. Although individually weak, their pack nature,
    high reproduction ability, and knowledge of weapons allow them to continually
    trouble folks all over the world.
